# Allow-list: the build context is only what the Dockerfile COPYs. Anything new
# in the repo (datasets, papers, local venvs, build outputs, secrets in a stray
# .env) stays out of the context by default instead of by remembering to list it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!src/
!docker/build-requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
